WEBVTT

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:12.360
"Kodomo no Omocha"

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
and your bitter face and bitter
feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.350
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.910
I may be a little jumbled,
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.870
I always feel Relax,

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:36.150
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:37.780
affiliated with Gekidan Komawari.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:40.450
My beloved Mama is a famous novelist,
who has even won the Aoki Laureate Prize,

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:42.450
and that's her chipmunk, Maro-chan.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.290
My former boyfriend, Sagami Rei-kun.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:47.790
Right now, he's earnestly on the way
to becoming a fine manager.

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:49.790
The mysterious white bat straight man.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:52.130
Feeling fabulous!

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:54.920
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend.

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.800
Oh, I haven't talked to him lately.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:01.640
The man who I declared was my boyfriend,
Take-chan, a.k.a. Gojo Takeshi-san.

00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:04.140
Mami-chan...

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:10.060
Mami-chan was really looking forward
to reading the essay,

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.150
asking when it was coming out, and all.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:15.820
What do I do? What do I do?

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.150
Here I am.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:18.700
So it seems.

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:24.490
There's something that's
gotten me a bit down, you see...

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:25.830
So it seems.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.830
Maybe I'll stay here forever.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:31.420
Maybe I'll stay here with you, Take-chan,
for the rest of my life.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:33.090
Sure.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:35.760
Let's stay here for the rest of our lives.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:38.760
I think I should go home.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:43.050
When I thought about spending
the rest of my life with you, Take-chan,

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:44.100
that's what suddenly happened.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:46.100
You really are amazing.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.850
You're going to go back, all on your own.

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:51.770
You're going to go back,
all under your own strength.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:53.270
Take-chan...

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:58.820
Sana-chan just left on her own,
heading back to Tokyo.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:06.450
This man Gojo- he may be
someone that Sana needs.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.120
Mami-chan...

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.460
--I'm sorry.
--I'm sorry.

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:11.120
I'm sorry.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:17.460
Take-chan... Take-chan... It went okay!
Take-chan, everything's all right!

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:24.140
Earthquake!!

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.850
--Earthquake! Earthquake! What do we do!?
--Don't panic! Keep calm!

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:29.810
--What do we do!?
--Commence taking shelter
under your desks!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.770
What are you doing!?

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:34.440
Have you forgotten that today
is the day we're been ordered out!?

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.110
Ordered out?

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.110
Surprise to me!

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.110
Prickly ash tree!

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.940
The landlord told us that this apartment
was going to be demolished,

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:41.070
so please leave, remember?

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:43.450
I never heard about it!

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:44.740
I did hear about it.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:49.910
"Under the Same Roof With You"

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.920
Come on! Let's get our things
out of here quickly!

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.090
A tragic sight to behold.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:04.760
We are without a place to stay again.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:06.430
Not to worry!

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:09.180
Oh, could that be, could that be?

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:15.770
Our new house! I built it with an advance
on the royalties from "My Daughter and I"!

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.440
Yay! All right!

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:21.490
That's my Mama! The life of our dreams
from royalties, and a masterful advance!

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.610
That's right, that's right!

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.160
--Tonight, we call Shimura-san back
and have a grand celebration!
--Um, about that...

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:30.120
--Yay! Yay! Party! Party! Go! Go!
--Go! Go! Party! Go! Go!
--Um...

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.080
Please, listen to me!

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:35.000
Actually, construction has fallen behind,

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:38.000
and they said they'd like
to extend it another week.

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:41.760
"Homeless after all."

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:48.760
Oh, no! I'm going to be tardy!
This is bad! This is bad!

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:52.270
Come on, come on!

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:55.440
Sana-chan, what's the matter?

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.770
Oh, I can't get through here.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:02.400
What if you took off your bag?

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:06.450
Sana-chan!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:10.790
I should use my head a little more.
Sana-chan concedes the point.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:14.120
What's with the bag?

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:17.120
Our apartment has been demolished,
and I don't have anywhere to live again.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.460
Right now, I'm in a homeless situation.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.460
Isn't that a big problem?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.800
It's okay, it's okay. I just
have to hold out for a week.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:29.140
But I don't have anywhere to put my stuff,
so I brought it with me.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:32.140
But then, it will all work itself out,
so it's okay.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:37.730
Oh! Work! Work!

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.400
Hayama, adios!

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.400
Kurata!

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.900
What, what?

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:49.740
If you don't have anywhere
else to go... wanna come over?

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:52.410
Huh? To your place, Hayama?

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:53.490
Yeah.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:59.920
Not to worry! I have one,
I have one! It's all right!

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:06.090
Whoo! Gotta go to work! See you later!

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.760
She has one?

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:11.430
Sana-chan, I'm sorry. Your bag
must have given you trouble, huh?

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.760
No big Konishiki, Mainoumi!

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:17.100
I got us a hotel room, so we should be okay
staying at the hotel for a little while.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.100
Is Mama at the hotel now?

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:21.770
Oh, Sensei said she would use this
opportunity to travel to Europe,

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.770
to gather some material she
had been planning on getting.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:27.110
Ah! That's her tour of
European hot spring spas!

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:31.120
--No fair, going off
and having fun by herself.
--She told me she was gathering material.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.740
Mama has never even tried to
gather material without having fun!

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.080
Now that you mention it...

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.080
Sagami! Take care of everything, okay?

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.080
...she did seem awfully cheerful.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.750
But Rei-kun, isn't it wrong for me
to be sharing a hotel room

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.420
all alone with my former boyfriend?

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:46.420
You're reading too much into it.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:50.090
No, it's wrong, it's wrong.
It would be dangerous! I'm not going!

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:52.510
You should spread your own wings
once in a while on your own, Rei-kun.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:53.760
Call up Asako-san,

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:57.100
and the two of you go to dinner,
and have a nice long chat or something.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:59.440
I guess I could do that...

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.310
No I couldn't!

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:03.230
"Where does Sana plan to stay?"

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.150
Say, Take-chan...

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:09.780
That's the right timing, huh?

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:12.320
Mm-hmm. That was good
just now, Take-chan.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:17.790
Can I come stay over at
your place tonight, Take-chan?

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:20.120
I'm kind of homeless right now, and all.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.460
Hold on, Sana-chan!

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:24.340
Oh, sorry, Rei-kun.
You can cancel the hotel.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.710
It would be an imposition, huh?
Huh? Huh?

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:39.390
"I don't mind"

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:39.390
"Welcome, Sana-san"

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:34.050
Whoa! He's put out the "okay" lamp!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:35.390
Surprised you?

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.010
Okay, this will be a take!

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.720
Sana-chan, Gojo-san, hurry!

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:39.730
Okay!

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:40.730
Sana-chan!

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.060
Sagami-san,

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.400
we have to help each other out
during hard times.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:49.030
Please don't worry, I will accept the
responsibility for looking after Sana-chan.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.070
All right, this will be a take!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.240
The father-daughter
eyewitnessing the eyewitness,

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.080
looking back while returning
from shopping scene!

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.540
Start!

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:03.080
Cut! Okay! That was a good one, Take-san.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.750
Indeed it was!

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.420
Oh, Vice-manager!

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.760
It looks like Gojo-kun has been
polishing up on his acting skills.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:14.760
Yes, he has. Lately, things have been
a lot different than they were before.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:18.430
It appears that the combination of him
and Sana-chan has gone well.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.100
Yes, yes! It's because of Sana-chan!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.560
What if we were to expand
Gojo-kun's appearances?

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:23.770
Re-write the script?

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.230
--R- right!
--Sana-chan's appearances, too!

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:29.110
Say, Take-chan, what should
we have for supper?

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:30.110
Cutlet-and-curry!

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.740
All right, cutlet-and-curry! Okay, okay!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.030
Sana-chan, Sana-chan...

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:36.030
Huh? Rei-kun, are you still here?

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:39.080
Well, something happened to catch my ear.

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:42.750
You should stop catching weird things
in your ear and hurry back to the hotel.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:43.410
Sana-chan!

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.040
Ah, Zenjiro-sensei!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.750
You sure are having a hard time of it.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.960
"At the scene of
Zenjiro-sensei's tasty work"

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.460
"Zenjiro-sensei"

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:53.420
"Klat 0t tnaw I!"

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:56.930
What was that? What was that?
What was "klat ot tnaw I"?

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.100
"I want to talk"

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.770
Without very many lines to say, lately,
his mouth has fallen out of practice,

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:01.970
and he wants to talk it up,
to let the words fly,

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.430
to say something, to say something,
but what can you do?

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.560
Zenjiro-sensei, are you
playing a bronze statue?

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:07.100
You got yourself some tasty work!

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:10.780
Good for you, good for you!
Congratulations! Bye now!

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:13.440
Sana-chan walked in, so let's
do that scene one more time!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.450
Why men?

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.110
"Siht htiw yako uoy era"

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.950
Do you know what that says?

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:21.120
"Are you okay with this!?"

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.450
Good grief, lately,
it's all "Take-chan, Take-chan."

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:26.750
Whenever he comes up,
she stops listening to what I say.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:30.420
When Sensei gets home, I'm going to
have her give her a stern talking-to.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.710
Okay, that strange fellow walked in,
so that was no good.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:34.550
We're doing a scene here, boneheads!

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:43.390
It's so big...

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.850
Maybe I will call Asako.

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:48.730
What am I doing!?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:53.570
And just who is this Gojo-san?

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.740
Pardon the intrusion!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.740
Wow, Take-chan, you keep it
neater than I expected!

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:07.330
Ah, today was a full day of work, huh?

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:13.750
Surprised you?

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.090
You set this up?

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:17.090
Mm-hmm, it's good for your health.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.550
Why, you, Take-chan!

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:22.100
You like to startle people
more than three meals a day!

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:23.430
Do you have to do this every day!?

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:26.020
You announced that
he's your boyfriend, Sana-chan.

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.890
You'll excuse me for
doing a little peeking in.

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:37.110
A fellow photographer, huh?

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:40.450
Judging from that lame costume of his,
I've never seen this guy.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.700
Did something just flash?

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:45.700
Huh? Are they here again?

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:49.040
Good work as always, you guys!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.040
We're in love with each other!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:53.880
The flowers of our love are in bloom!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:59.380
Has the snake reporter appeared again
after a long absence with another scheme?

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:02.050
That's not it. Something doesn't fit here...

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:03.050
What's that?

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:06.060
I don't know, I just have a hunch.

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.060
A hunch, huh?

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.930
Are these two close pals now?

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:17.110
Just what I was worried about.
More dirty tricks from Drea-Pro.

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:27.750
Kurosaki-kun, you've got to give them
to me if you've got them!

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:30.080
Another outfit broke the story, you know!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:33.750
Yeah, well, it just doesn't make
any sense that they are lovers.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.460
It doesn't matter,
as long as it's interesting!

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:38.090
It's too late now,
we can't do a follow-up!

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:39.760
--I think I'll look into it some more.
--Are you listening to me, Kurosaki!?

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:40.760
Why don't you?

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:43.090
Is this for real!?
Did you really stay the night?

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.100
Mm-hmm, I sure did.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:50.100
But won't it hurt your reputation to have
a boyfriend like this old guy, Sana-chan?

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:54.440
It doesn't matter!
After all, I really do love him.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.440
What's so great about this old guy?

00:11:56.440 --> 00:12:00.110
I think he's got great style.
He might become more popular now.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.780
That's my Aya-chan!
You've got a good eye for men!

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:06.780
O- oh my, Sana-chan...
y- you're embarrassing me...

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:08.580
--You think it would be in our interest
--It's true, she does have a good eye.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.790
--to start a fan club
before he becomes popular?
--It's true, she does have a good eye.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:13.120
--Uh-huh! You bet! You can get
all the autographs you want right now!
--I mean, Aya-chan always has been keen.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:15.130
Well, I'll become a fan, too!

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.590
Huh? If you are, Aya-chan,
then I will, too!

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:23.470
I'm member number 2, Sasaki Tsuyoshi!

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:25.340
We've started a Gojo-san fan club!

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.470
And the inauguration party is going
to be held at Gojo-san's place!

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:29.140
Akito-kun, wanna come? Wanna come?

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.470
Makes no difference to me.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:34.850
Ah, I knew you would say that.
Yeah, Akito-kun, you wouldn't come, huh?

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:37.110
--Bye, then.
--What choice do I have?

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:41.110
If you're going to
beg me that much, I'll go.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:44.110
But I didn't even beg you...

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:46.450
Akito-kun...

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:49.990
--W- what are you thinking?
--Seriously.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.330
I love you, Margarine!

00:12:55.960 --> 00:13:00.050
"Sana-chan's drawing song"

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:58.880
I know this is sudden,
but here's a Sana-chan drawing song.

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:00.050
Get your paper and crayon ready!

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:02.380
First there comes a mountain, and then,

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.380
water comes splashing down from it.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:06.390
Get two cups ready,

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:08.390
and then add two handles.

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:10.390
Butterflies come flying in,

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.390
with tails growing out of their behinds.

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:14.730
Here a slope, there a slope, ups-a-daisy,

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.730
and draw in the eye like an arrow.

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.730
Let's draw one more arrow.

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:20.730
It's time for gym, so bring out
the vaulting boxes.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:22.740
Stick a second one on top of it,

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.740
The letter "ku," the letter "ku,"
the letter "ku," hey!

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.070
Then we stick six beans on.

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:29.070
And now we've drawn Sana-chan!

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:31.080
Dance! Dance! Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:34.540
This is the Sana-chan drawing song!

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.330
Here it is, here it is!

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:41.340
It's so exciting to be going
over to a performer's house, huh?

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.840
And it's the man that
Sana-chan has fallen in love with.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.340
He's sure to be a really great guy.

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:46.970
However...

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:53.020
I get the feeling that something is
going to happen with Hayama-kun here.

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:55.680
Mm-hmm. A little uneasy...

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:58.020
...and yet a little fun to watch...

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:02.360
Akito-kun, please, don't go picking a fight
like you did that time with Sagami-san.

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:03.400
Shut up.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:07.030
"That time with Sagami-san..."

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:07.070
Please enjoy these highlights
of that time with Sagami-san.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.200
Don't go around playing children for fools.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.200
"And that was it..."

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.040
Yes! Gojo here!

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:18.040
--"Gojo here"?
--Sana-chan?

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.380
Ah, Hisae-chan, I've been expecting you!
Come on up to the eighth floor.

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:25.050
There are old newspapers left next to
the entrance, so don't trip over them.

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:28.050
Sounds like Sana-chan is
treating it like her own house.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:34.680
Come on in! Don't let all
the grime surprise you, okay?

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.680
I seem like a housewife, don't I?

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:38.690
Come on, Sana-chan.

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:40.310
You do, you do!

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.940
--Pardon the intrusion!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:53.370
A- Akito-kun, take your
shoes off right, okay?

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.370
Sure.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.700
It's okay, it's okay!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:58.370
Take-chan, they're all here!

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:01.380
Hey, everyone, thanks for coming.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:02.710
Is that him, is that him?

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.630
Mm-hmm, it's really him.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:09.720
Oh, Hayama saw Gojo-san!

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:10.380
Old dude.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.090
Oh my, such a frank impression.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.100
"The party has started..."

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:23.400
M- my own fan... fan club...

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:27.400
Take-chan, are you blushing?
You're so stiff! Clink-clink!

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.400
--He seems kind of dull, huh?
--I'm just so nervous.

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.070
Well, if I may be so bold,

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:34.660
allow me to take the ondo in proposing a toast.
(Ondo: take the lead or take the temperature)

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:38.660
The current temperature is...
11°C. Indeed...

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:40.660
That's not the right ondo!

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:42.000
That was an old hack's gag.

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:45.000
He does seem to make for a
good pairing with Sana-chan, though.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.340
Now then, to celebrate the founding
of the Take-chan fan club...

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:51.010
Ordinarily, you wouldn't be
celebrating yourself, huh?

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:52.010
Oppai!
("Boobies")

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.010
That's kampai!
("cheers!")

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:56.140
I'm getting a headache.

00:15:57.010 --> 00:16:00.850
Akito-kun, Gojo-san sure
is an amusing man, huh?

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.150
What's wrong, Hayama?

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.360
A- Akito-kun...

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:17.030
Don't do anything rash...

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:20.370
Where's the bathroom?

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.370
I sure am hungry.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:26.040
It's barbecue time! It's barbecue time!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:30.460
And so, it's time for
our main event, the cookout.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.630
Meat! Meat! Meat! Where's the meat!?

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:37.010
We can't start the barbecue
without the meat! Where are you, meat!?

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:38.350
Take-chan, do you know?

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.350
We forgot to break
open the kusudama ball.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:43.060
Take-chan, never mind the kusudama,
where's the meat!?

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.650
Meat!

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:54.700
There it is!
Take-chan's forte grand broiling!

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:56.030
Surprised you?

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:58.910
For seasoning, it's Sana's special sauce!

00:16:57.990 --> 00:16:58.780
"Treasure"/"Handle With Care"

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:07.330
Go on, it's delicious! Eat up!

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:09.500
W- we have to eat this?

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:17.840
"What the hell kind of cooking is this?"

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:23.390
Be strong, Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:27.060
Sana-chan's sauce is intense...

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:29.480
I'm surprised it doesn't
bother those three.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:38.990
Sana-chan's cooking is delicious,
huh... um... Hayama-kun?

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:39.990
Delicious.

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:41.740
Don't force yourself, Hayama!

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.000
--Thanks for having us.

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.670
Sure! Come again, okay?

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.420
See you later.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:51.670
Those two are weird.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.670
They do seem right for each other.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:56.010
We just can't keep up with them.

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:59.260
"The fan club dissolves"

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:59.430
And so, the fan club was
dissolved after three hours.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:04.430
Parties sure are fun, but cleaning up
after them is a lot of work.

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:09.020
Hayama there is my good friend
and natural enemy.

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:12.690
He's got a poor attitude,
but he's still a pretty good guy.

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.400
Wow, these bubbles are amazing!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:17.030
The bubbles... the bubbles...
the bubbles are attacking me!

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:19.110
Look, Take-chan!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.000
Tuckered out?

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:36.420
It's Mito Komon! Ha ha!

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.600
Don't catch cold, now.

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:54.150
This week's Sana-chan!
Young wife style- maybe too young.

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.660
This tastes nasty!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.660
W- where are we?

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.660
We got out of that apartment safely, then?
Thank goodness!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:05.660
Of course we did.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:09.750
To think we made it out alive
after eating that cooking!

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:14.340
So then, is that man
really Sana-chan's boyfriend?

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:17.340
It did kind of seem like it, but then
it also seems completely different...

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:19.720
What did you think, Akito-kun?

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:28.140
Well, Akito-kun? Akito-kun, I say...

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.140
They're like...

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:34.360
...father and daughter, aren't they?

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:39.650
Snake, you're on!

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.530
"The snake reporter appears!"

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:44.660
I see... So Gojo-san lived here
up until thirteen years ago, then?

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:49.330
That's right. After that, I heard
that he left abruptly for America.

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:53.000
Now, do you know the name of the woman
who he was seeing at that time?

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:58.000
I don't recall her last name, but as
I recall, her first name was Keiko...

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:00.670
yes, she was named Keiko-san.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:02.090
Keiko?

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:06.100
"And so, Misako-san returns home"

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:10.680
Sensei!

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:15.360
Thanks for coming to pick me up,
Mister Sagami.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.020
How are you?

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:18.020
I'm fine.

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:22.700
Oh, it's great! Did anything
happen while I was away?

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:23.700
W-well...

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:26.030
Oh, yay!

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:27.030
Sana?

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:29.040
Yes, the whole time.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:31.370
She's been going to school
from this Gojo-san's place,

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:32.960
the one who we don't know anything about.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.540
I'll bet she's not
doing her homework, either.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:37.290
If I don't keep an eye on her...

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:38.630
This will not do.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:39.960
Agreed.

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:43.970
I meant your tattling on her
will not do. You, you.

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:46.640
Well, you did ask me what happened
while you were away, Sensei...

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.430
Watch in front of you when you're driving!

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:57.060
Dan-da-da-dan! Sana-chan's new house
has been completed!

00:20:57.980 --> 00:20:59.320
Sensei!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.650
Shimura!

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:04.990
Sensei! I've been so looking forward
for this day to come!

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:07.660
You have, you have...
you're so good to us...

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:12.660
A new home is so nice! It's all shiny!
Everywhere you look, it's all shiny!

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:14.330
All right! Bravo!

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:17.670
My enjoyable new house!

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:20.000
Sana should be here, dancing around.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.340
She's late, huh?

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:23.670
Oh, she's home!

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:25.050
Zoom!

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:39.480
Who are you?

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:44.650
As it happens, I have some information
I'd like for you to buy from me.

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:51.030
It's about this Gojo-san that Sana-chan
has announced as being her boyfriend.

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:55.710
I've discovered that they do in fact
have a very interesting relationship.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:59.040
Well, Take-chan, make sure you eat well.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:01.130
Take care of yourself, now.

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:05.550
Okay, I'll come by again some other time.

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:09.010
Surprised you?

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:14.100
W- what did you say!?

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:20.400
W- what did he say!?

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:25.900
Gojo Takeshi is... Sana's true father?

00:22:36.710 --> 00:22:39.000
It's all DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:41.880
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:43.960
Bye Bye Bye

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:46.590
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:48.510
and your body will be healthy,

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:50.430
so resolve when to give up

00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:52.390
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:22:52.390 --> 00:22:53.720
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken)

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:55.560
(Tidak apa-apa,
Nday kambay kambay)

00:22:55.560 --> 00:22:58.020
It's always the same old nonsense,

00:22:58.140 --> 00:23:00.480
U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI

00:23:00.520 --> 00:23:03.060
(Mm? Could be you're fairly dumb...)

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:05.690
and then later comes the whimpering,

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:08.240
KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:10.990
(Ah... it's fine, it's fine, it's fine)

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:13.280
It's all crazy over there,

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:15.200
it's all "waah!" over here,

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:18.540
and the whole Earth
is spinning the wrong way.

00:23:18.660 --> 00:23:22.380
So at this point now, yeah at this point now,

00:23:22.500 --> 00:23:26.670
you can laugh it away, excuse me, I must be going.

00:23:26.710 --> 00:23:28.590
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:28.720 --> 00:23:31.430
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:33.350
Bye Bye Bye

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:36.220
Cuz you tried your MECHA-KUCHA best,

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:38.100
to PECHA-KUCHA out a "Hi,"

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:40.060
so just keep going unlike this!

00:23:40.190 --> 00:23:41.940
Wai Wai Wai Wai

00:23:42.060 --> 00:23:43.860
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:48.780
Once your lips touch, you can't change your mind.

00:23:49.190 --> 00:23:51.450
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:23:51.610 --> 00:23:53.370
and your body will be healthy,

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:55.330
so resolve when to give up

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:58.870
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:23:58.950 --> 00:24:01.120
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken,
Tidak apa-apa)

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:03.080
(Gwaenchansseumnida,
kwenchanayo)

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:04.460
(Mou man tail)

00:24:08.630 --> 00:24:11.630
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:11.630 --> 00:24:13.640
Take-chan, aka Gojo Takeshi-san...

00:24:13.640 --> 00:24:15.970
We met by chance when he was playing
the role of my father in a drama.

00:24:15.970 --> 00:24:20.310
When I looked into his warm eyes,
my whole body immediately felt lighter.

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:23.650
I love you, Take-chan.
Let's stay together forever, okay?

00:24:23.650 --> 00:24:25.940
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
episode 48,

00:24:25.940 --> 00:24:27.650
a sudden twist in the "new destiny series,"

00:24:27.650 --> 00:24:30.320
where two secrets about Take-chan
are made known!

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:32.320
Father, You Are My Father

00:24:32.320 --> 00:24:34.320
"Father, You Are My Father"

00:24:34.320 --> 00:24:37.160
H- he's your father!?
